attack"},{"surface":"கொல்","parts":[{"text":"கொல்","lemma":"கொல்","gloss":"whether"}],"gloss":"whether"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஓரேன்","parts":[{"text":"ஓர்","lemma":"ஓர்","gloss":"know"},{"text":"ஏன்","lemma":"ஏன்","gloss":"I (negative)"}],"gloss":"I do not know"},{"surface":"யானும்","parts":[{"text":"யான்","lemma":"யான்","gloss":"I"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"also"}],"gloss":"I also"},{"surface":"ஓர்","parts":[{"text":"ஓர்","lemma":"ஓர்","gloss":"one"}],"gloss":"a"},{"surface":"பெற்றி","parts":[{"text":"பெற்றி","lemma":"பெற்றி","gloss":"pretext"}],"gloss":"pretext"},{"surface":"மேலிட்டு","parts":[{"text":"மேல்","lemma":"மேல்","gloss":"upon"},{"text":"இட்டு","lemma":"இடு","gloss":"having placed"}],"gloss":"having assumed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஆஅ","parts":[{"text":"ஆஅ","lemma":"ஆஅ","gloss":"Ah!"}],"gloss":"Ah!"},{"surface":"ஒல்லென","parts":[{"text":"ஒல்","lemma":"ஒல்","gloss":"sound 'ol'"},{"text":"என","lemma":"என","gloss":"saying"}],"gloss":"loudly"},{"surface":"கூவுவேன்","parts":[{"text":"கூவு","lemma":"கூவு","gloss":"cry out"},{"text":"வேன்","lemma":"வேன்","gloss":"I (future)"}],"gloss":"I will cry out"},{"surface":"கொல்","parts":[{"text":"கொல்","lemma":"கொல்","gloss":"whether"}],"gloss":"whether"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அலமரல்","parts":[{"text":"அலமரல்","lemma":"அலமரல்","gloss":"whirling"}],"gloss":"whirling"},{"surface":"அசை","parts":[{"text":"அசை","lemma":"அசை","gloss":"moving"}],"gloss":"moving"},{"surface":"வளி","parts":[{"text":"வளி","lemma":"வளி","gloss":"wind"}],"gloss":"wind"},{"surface":"அலைப்ப","parts":[{"text":"அலை","lemma":"அலை","gloss":"beat"},{"text":"ப்ப","lemma":"ப்ப","gloss":"as"}],"gloss":"as it beats"},{"surface":"என்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"my"}],"gloss":"my"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"உயவு","parts":[{"text":"உயவு","lemma":"உயவு","gloss":"distress"}],"gloss":"distress"},{"surface":"நோய்","parts":[{"text":"நோய்","lemma":"நோய்","gloss":"pain"}],"gloss":"pain"},{"surface":"அறியாது","parts":[{"text":"அறி","lemma":"அறி","gloss":"know"},{"text":"யாது","lemma":"யாது","gloss":"without"}],"gloss":"not knowing"},{"surface":"துஞ்சும்","parts":[{"text":"துஞ்சு","lemma":"துஞ்சு","gloss":"sleep"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"which"}],"gloss":"sleeping"},{"surface":"ஊர்க்கே","parts":[{"text":"ஊர்","lemma":"ஊர்","gloss":"town"},{"text":"க்கு","lemma":"க்கு","gloss":"to"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"to the town indeed"}]}],"literal":"Shall I set fire? Shall I attack? / I do not know, I too, taking up some pretext, / shall I cry out loudly 'Ah!'? / As the whirling, moving wind beats, my / distressful pain not knowing, to the sleeping town indeed!","translation":"Shall I set fire to it? Shall I attack it? I do not know. Or should I, taking up some pretext, scream out loud, 'Ah!'? To this town that sleeps peacefully, completely unaware of my agonizing pain, while the swirling, restless wind beats against me.","modern":"சுழன்று வீசும் காற்று என்னை வருத்த, என்னுடைய துன்ப நோயை அறியாமல் தூங்குகின்ற இந்த ஊருக்கு, நான் தீ வைப்பேனோ? அல்லது தாக்குவேனோ? எனக்குத் தெரியவில்லை. அல்லது ஏதேனும் ஒரு காரணத்தை முன்னிட்டு 'ஆ' என்று சத்தமிட்டுக் கூச்சல் போடுவேனோ?","explanation":"This poem is spoken by the heroine to herself during the night in the pālai (separation) landscape. She is suffering intensely from the pain of separation from her lover, while the rest of the town is fast asleep, completely indifferent to her agony. The cold, restless wind blows and torments her further, highlighting her isolation. Frustrated by the town's peaceful ignorance of her distress, she contemplates extreme actions: setting fire to the town, attacking it, or screaming out loud to disrupt their sleep. The contrast between her internal turmoil and the quiet, sleeping town emphasizes the depth of her grief. Key words like 'uyavu-nōy' (distressful pain) and 'tuñcum ūr' (sleeping town) capture the essence of her lonely suffering.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.9],[0.9,1.1],[1.1,1.5],[1.5,3.3],[3.3,3.7],[3.7,3.8],[3.8,4.1],[4.1,4.1],[4.1,4.93],[5.77,6.6],[6.6,7.6],[7.6,9.1],[9.1,9.4],[9.4,10.2],[10.2,11.85],[11.85,12.1],[12.1,12.5],[12.5,13.0]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,1.0],[1.0,1.2],[1.2,1.9],[1.9,3.8],[3.8,4.2],[4.2,4.3],[4.3,4.7],[4.7,4.7],[4.7,6.3],[6.3,6.7],[6.7,8.7],[8.7,10.3],[10.3,10.6],[10.6,11.3],[11.3,12.8],[12.8,13.0],[13.0,13.6],[13.6,14.1]]}}